# (tick-door) Two BUD-triggered reach-through 0-ticks in ONE tick: when P_TR pulls TR up, W
# (quasi-powered at rest by R_B, push blocked by the door row) extends into the emptied corner;
# its base update fires killer K (armed by the scripted block, blocked by P_Y's head until k1),
# K shoves R_B, K's move updates W, W retracts in the same phase and pulls T into the corner;
# T leaving N1 fires A' the same way (killer K_A): C leaves the center at k1.
design designs/gadgets/killer-chain.txt
probe TR 2 2 0
probe N1 1 2 0
probe C 1 1 0
quiet 2
set 5 2 0 minecraft:redstone_block
set 1 3 2 minecraft:redstone_block
clear 4 6 0
clear 1 7 1
clear 2 5 0
trace 1
expect C .
expect N1 ~
expect TR ~
